# Documents collected for measuring the extractor -- specimen British paperwork
# and the owner's own documents. They stay out of git whatever their licence
# (owner, 2026-09-15); only counts, score lines and the licence record travel.
# The collection itself lives outside any repo, in ~/projects/.scratch/uk-specimens/.
documents/
specimens/
uk-specimens/
# ...but `documents/` with no leading slash matches a directory of that name at
# any depth, and src/server/documents is the extractor's own source. Tracked
# files there were unaffected, since ignoring never untracks; a NEW file there
# was silently unaddable until this line (caught on !929, 2026-09-15).
!src/server/documents/
scripts/extract-bundle/docs/
scripts/extract-bundle/out/
